<title>FRANCE: TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF SAMPRAS V CLAVET.</title>
<headline>TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF SAMPRAS V CLAVET.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics of Wednesday's French Open men's singles second round match between top seed Pete Sampras and Spaniard Francisco Clavet (world ranking in brackets).</p>
<p>Sampras won 6-1 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Time: one hour 27 minutes</p>
<p>SAMPRAS (1)   CLAVET (31)</p>
<p>Aces 7 0</p>
<p>Double faults 4 0</p>
<p>Percentage first serves 56 64</p>
<p>Forehand winners 19 5</p>
<p>Backhand winners 2 1</p>
